  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Banner",
    "Description",
    "Bold full-width notification for top-of-page or top-of-app messages. High-priority alternative to Alert for announcements, outages, or global states.",
    "Variants",
    "default   Neutral announcement.\ninfo      Feature release, maintenance notice.\nsuccess   Global confirmation (rare — usually Toast fits better).\nwarning   Degraded service or approaching limit.\ndanger    Outage, billing issue, blocked state.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Single line with truncation at narrow widths.\nOne optional action link (right-aligned).\nOne optional close button.\nWrite as a statement, not a question: 'Scheduled maintenance Friday 10pm PT'.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Pin to the top of the page or app shell\nDO   Use for global or page-wide states\nDO   Keep to a single line\nDO   Offer exactly one action at most",
    "DON'T   Stack multiple banners\nDON'T   Use for inline form validation\nDON'T   Hide critical banners behind a collapse\nDON'T   Use success banners for transient outcomes"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
